SUMMARY:APEC 2027: Technical session digest submission (23:59 UTC+12 (assum
 ed))
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Applied Power Electronics Conference and Exposition (APEC 
 2027)\n\nTechnical session digest submission: 21 Aug 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (
 assumed)\n\nConference: March 7-11\, 2027\nLocation: New Orleans\, USA\nVe
 nue: Ernest N. Morial Convention Center\n\nAll dates:\n  Technical session
  digest submission: 21 Aug 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Acceptance and
  decline notices: 12 Oct 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final manuscript
  and author registration: 7 Dec 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call 
 for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it
  could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline
  rather than after it.\n\nThe digest deadline was extended from 14 to 21 A
 ugust 2026. An author manuscript training session is held on 12 November 2
 026.\n\nCall for papers: https://apec-conf.org/\nDetails: https://langeste
 fan.github.io/powersystem-deadlines/conference/apec27
LOCATION:New Orleans\, USA
URL;VALUE=URI:https://apec-conf.org/
CATEGORIES:Power Electronics,Machines & Drives,Energy Storage,EV & Transpor
 tation
